rove payments above £500.\n\n## 6. Matters not covered\n6.1 These rules do not set a maximum number of trustee terms.\n6.2 They do not prescribe a method for resolving personal disputes.\n6.3 They do not specify whether trustees may attend remotely.\n","numLines":45,"startLine":1,"totalLines":45}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011DegLu7nTu5WVpev19kkXb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
